    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-4",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Run the CLI `status`; the client may already be signed in.…",
      "text": "Run the CLI `status`; the client may already be signed in. Check the connection’s capabilities: Grid, Secrets, Locale and Tasks tools only work when the connection has that capability. After updating the client or changing permissions, restart or reconnect the MCP server.",
      "assetId": null,
