    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-7",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "For published Grid reads, `INVALID_KEY` means the API key…",
      "text": "For published Grid reads, `INVALID_KEY` means the API key is malformed, revoked, rotated or missing the Published Grid content scope, and `KEY_REQUIRED` means the request sent no key.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
