    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-9",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Your role on the resource, or the connection’s capability,…",
      "text": "Your role on the resource, or the connection’s capability, does not allow the action. Ask someone who manages the resource for access, or change the connection under **Settings → Your agent connections → Edit permissions**. Some actions—publishing, granting access, approving secret reviews, managing API keys—are browser-only and never available to agents.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
