    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-11",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Someone changed the resource after you read it, a review…",
      "text": "Someone changed the resource after you read it, a review is pending, or the change needs reconciling. Read the current version and redo your change on top of it; never force an overwrite. Creating a product in a workspace with Products turned off also returns `409` with `PRODUCTS_OFF`.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
